@page
@model AboutModel
@{
    ViewData["Title"] = "About";
    ViewData["Nav"] = "About";
    ViewData["FooterNote"] = "END OF SECTION 02";
}

<section class="prose-page">
    <h1>About Me</h1>

    <p class="prose-page__lead">
    I am a Software Engineering undergraduate at iACADEMY Cebu interested in software development.
    Through my web and mobile projects, I have gained practical frontend and backend experience while developing skills in Scrum management and Agile workflows.
    Learning multiple technologies has also taught me to use my capabilities efficiently to produce functional, reliable work aligned with general standards.
    </p>

    <p>
    My project experiences have given me hands-on experience in areas of software development such as UI development, database integration, authentication, backend services, and AI/LLM integration.
    Through these projects, I have learned to create practical, user-focused applications, improve them incrementally based on user needs, and understand how different components work together as a complete system. 
    Beyond software development, I serve as the head of my school's editorial group, which has strengthened my leadership, communication, and teamwork skills.
    </p>

    <dl class="prose-page__facts">
        <div><dt>BASED</dt><dd>[Cebu, Philippines]</dd></div>
        <div><dt>DISCIPLINE</dt><dd>[Software Engineering]</dd></div>
        <div><dt>TOOLS</dt><dd>[C&#35; / Java / DOTNET, Flutter, SQL, SQLite, PostgreSQL, Django, Firebase, Typescript, CSS, Javascript]</dd></div>
        <div><dt>AVAILABLE</dt><dd>[Open to Work]</dd></div>
    </dl>
</section>

@section Aside {
    <div class="scratch"
         data-scratch="/Images/placeholder.png"
         data-reveal-pool="/Images/random-pics/caveman gumball.webp,/Images/random-pics/baddie-res.png,/Images/random-pics/niles-cat.png,/Images/random-pics/step-kori.png">
        <img class="scratch__reveal" alt="A surprise image, revealed by scratching">
        <canvas class="scratch__cover" role="img" aria-label="Scratch the outline to reveal the image"></canvas>
    </div>
}